        {
          "text": "Reka disables automatic BOS insertion and supplies tokenizer.eos_token_id plus the literal '<sep>' as stop conditions. The existing chat loop encodes the formatted context with special-token handling and passes the selected stop conditions to Job.",
          "basis": "source",
          "evidence": ["call_31c5107b639c4511ac4ee3df90023e78", "call_1e72f88082c74a70bf0c01af3531ecbf"]
        },
        {
          "text": "With --think, get_input_ids appends Reka's exact opening string ' <reasoning>\\n'. Streaming receives '</reasoning>' as its closing marker. Streamer_rich searches its accumulated thinking text for that marker before starting Markdown output; Streamer_basic accepts but does not interpret the marker.",
